@@ -12,6 +12,13 @@ See the [Contributing Guide](contributing.md) for details.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Footnotes are now numbered and ordered by the order in which they are
+  referenced in the document rather than the order in which they are defined.
+  A new `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER` configuration option has been added to the
+  [footnotes](extensions/footnotes.md) extension to restore the previous behavior.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
